OL,3,ATwo die at Moldovan border as
OL,4,ARussia-Ukraine drone war rages
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people died when Russian drones hit
OL,7,Fa border crossing between Ukraine and
OL,8,FMoldova, Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,9,FZelensky has said.
OL,11,FThe Starokozache crossing was shut
OL,12,Fafter the overnight attack. Images from
OL,13,Fthe scene show several burnt-out cars
OL,14,Famid the debris.
OL,16,FIn the Ukrainian capital Kyiv, a woman
OL,17,Fwas killed and 14 people, including two
OL,18,Fchildren, were injured after a Russian
OL,19,Fdrone hit a nine-storey residential
OL,20,Fhouse, officials say.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
