OL,3,ATwo die at Moldovan border as
OL,4,ARussia-Ukraine drone war rages
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Russia, four people, including a
OL,7,Fchild, were killed in the Black Sea
OL,8,Fport of Novorossiysk in a Ukrainian
OL,9,Fdrone attack, officials there say, and
OL,10,Fa drone hit an industrial facility in
OL,11,Fthe Arctic city of Novy Urengoy, nearly
OL,12,F3,000km (1,864 miles) from Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
